hey everybody Shaw McGinnis here with a  game guide from Miguel concepción just  like in the first forts of horizon your  car collection and horizon 2 isn't  complete unless you found all the relics  hidden throughout the game map in the  new setting of France and Italy there  are 10 vehicles to find all waiting to  be restored by making general progress  in the game you'll hear rumors of new  barn locations indicated by a  semi-transparent white circle on the map  in our playthrough the tenth barn  revealed itself when we reached level 60  some barns can take you a minute to find  while others might take you a half an  hour  our guide provides some of the most  direct routes to each bar  first start on the highway east of the  golf course and set your marker on the  road south of the speed trap at the west  point of San Giovanni when you reach the  Waypoint look for the section where the  road barrier begins then head north  about a quarter mile  [Music]  number two begin at the west point of  nice using the hint circle as a frame of  reference set the marker on the road  south of the wishbone shaped patch of  forest once you've reached the Waypoint  head north and look for a beaten path  the barn is about 1/8 of a mile north  [Music]  number three start at the west side of  the golf course near st. Martin set the  destination marker at the middle of the  road that cuts through the lower half of  the hint circle after reaching the  Waypoint head north through the rows of  trees look for a blue tractor to easily  locate the bar  [Music]  number four begin at the West outskirts  of sister on set the marker at the  southern section of the hint circle at  the T intersection once you've reached  your destination follow the beaten path  north and drive through the dried-up  river the bard can be found on the other  side of the river  [Music]  number five start at the Northwest  outskirts of Casta Leto set the Waypoint  at the upper corner of the u-shaped  paved path that runs through the hint  circle once you've reached your  destination head east and slightly north  through the small forest to find the bar  [Music]  number six begin on the road east of the  word Montelena on the map set the marker  slightly north of the cross intersection  in the hint circle where the forest  meets the fields on the map once you've  reached the Waypoint drive east look for  the large open storage area the barn is  slightly north east of that  number seven  starting at the hub and Montelena set  the waypoint at the short straightaway  that runs from north to south  inside the hint circle once you've  reached your destination head west for  about 1/8 of a mile  [Music]  number eight start at the hub in San  Giovanni set the Waypoint to the part of  the road that makes a 90-degree turn in  the middle of the hint circle when  you've reached the marker simply  continue on straight up the hill for a  couple of seconds to find the bar  [Music]  number nine begin at the south point of  San Giovanni on the three parallel roads  within the hint circle set the Waypoint  in the middle of the bottom road once  you've reached the marker head north up  the hill you'll find the bar and amongst  the various structures in this secluded  spot  [Music]  and finally number 10 this is the  easiest barn find of them all just drive  slightly south of the letter F in the  map text horizon festival  [Music]  and there you have it that's all ten of  the barn fines and forts of horizon 2 if  you have any other tips for finding  these let us know in the comments  [Music]
 

